remain consistent throughout the shot.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nA faint clock tick and quiet apartment room tone sit beneath the distant city ambience. The phone makes a soft handling sound as the father presses and releases its recording control.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nN/A"
